# GoldVista (Aurum Intelligence)
## Next-Generation Product Vision & Technical Enhancement Blueprint — Implementation Addendum Prompt

> **Purpose:** Give this prompt, the governing Next-Generation Product Vision & Technical Enhancement Blueprint, and the **8 November 2026 v1.4.0-PRO-ENTERPRISE Phase Completion Report** to the coding agent working in the GoldVista repository. This addendum makes repository evidence, safe execution, and measurable acceptance mandatory. It is an instruction to inspect, reconcile, design, and then implement the roadmap in controlled increments—not permission to assume the report is accurate or to replace the existing product wholesale.

